      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">R 2</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">represents a divalent organic group containing an oxyalkylene group and the organic group may be linear, branched or cyclic, or may contain one or more elements other than carbon, hydrogen and oxygen</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
      </li>
