        <span itemprop="definition">may be configured irregularly; provided that when the unit represented by formula (1) is present in plurality in the same molecule, the R 1 or R 2 groups or the values represented by x, y or z are independent from each other and need not be the same].</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
