      </li>
      <li itemprop="definitions" itemscope repeat>
        <span itemprop="subject">the ion conductivity of the film after the solution absorption at 25° C.</span>
        <span itemprop="definition">was measured by an impedance method and determined to be 1.5 ⁇ 10 -3 S/cm.</span>
        <meta itemprop="num_attr" content="">
