    <div class="description-paragraph">
      </div> <pre xml:space="preserve" listing-type="equation">CH.sub.2 ═C(R.sup.1)CO[O(CH.sub.2).sub.x (CH (CH.sub.3)).sub.y ].sub.z NHCOO(R.sup.3 O).sub.n --                                 (2)</pre>
    
